<h1 class="specialh1">Community Safety Policy</h1> 
<p>Our website allows users to share information about places or situations they believe may be unsafe. Users can submit photos, descriptions, and locations to help others stay aware of potential hazards.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">What You Can Report</h2> 
<p>Users may report things such as damaged roads, dangerous areas, hazardous objects, suspicious environmental conditions, or other situations that could present a safety concern.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Be Accurate</h2> 
<p>Only submit information that you believe is accurate. Do not knowingly create false reports, exaggerate situations, or submit misleading information.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Respect Other People</h2> 
<p>Do not use this website to harass, threaten, or target another person. Avoid posting personal information about individuals, including names, phone numbers, addresses, or other private information.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Photos and Content</h2> 
<p>Only upload images and content that you have permission to share. Do not upload inappropriate, threatening, or harmful content.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Location Information</h2> 
<p>Location information should be used to identify the general area of a potential safety concern. Do not intentionally submit someone's private home or personal location as a way to target them.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Not an Emergency Service</h2> 
<p>This website is not a replacement for emergency services. If there is an immediate danger or emergency, contact the appropriate emergency services instead of relying on a community report.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Report Review</h2> 
<p>Submitted reports may be reviewed, modified, or removed if they violate this policy or contain inappropriate, misleading, or unsafe content.</p> 

<h2 class="specialh2">Community Responsibility</h2> 
<p>The goal of this website is to help people become more aware of potential safety concerns in their community. Please use the platform responsibly and consider the safety and privacy of others when submitting information.</p>

